// ===========================================================================
// 2. ISO/IEC 27001:2022 Annex A — real 2022 structure: Organizational (37),
//    People (8), Physical (14), Technological (34) = 93 controls in the
//    real standard. We represent ~46 of the most load-bearing ones here,
//    using genuine Annex A topic names/clause numbers, grouped into the
//    four real themes. This is a representative subset, not the full 93.
// ===========================================================================
